bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary Router
control AccessTokenGuard
control UsersController
control UsersService
entity ":UsersModel" as UsersModel
database MongoDB

User -> Router: 1. GET /emoji-packs-own
activate User
activate Router

Router -> AccessTokenGuard: 2. canActivate(request)
activate AccessTokenGuard

AccessTokenGuard -> AccessTokenGuard: 3. Validate token
activate AccessTokenGuard
space
deactivate AccessTokenGuard

opt Token invalid
  AccessTokenGuard --> Router: 3.1 Deny
  Router --> User: 3.2 401 Unauthorized
end

AccessTokenGuard --> Router: 4. Allow
deactivate AccessTokenGuard

Router -> UsersController: 5. getUserEmojiPacksOwn(req)
activate UsersController

UsersController -> UsersController: 6. Extract userId from req.user
activate UsersController
space
deactivate UsersController

UsersController -> UsersService: 7. getEmojiPacksOwn(userId)
activate UsersService

UsersService -> UsersModel: 8. Find emoji packs
activate UsersModel

UsersModel -> MongoDB: 9. Find emoji packs
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UsersModel: 10. Return result
deactivate MongoDB

UsersModel --> UsersService: 11. Return result
deactivate UsersModel

UsersService --> UsersController: 12. Return result
deactivate UsersService

UsersController --> Router: 13. Return result
deactivate UsersController

Router --> User: 14. Return result
deactivate Router
deactivate User